'Exact solutions for the recovered rationals','Forp=41,q=840, t≡41r mod840 because41²≡1 mod840. Forp=5,q=12, t≡5r mod12. At r=1 the solutions include(t,s)=(41,−2) and(5,−2), respectively.',
